check-name = Check the vault
check-under = Reads every object and cover back and weighs it against what went in. Check changes nothing; Mend acts on what it finds.
prune-name = Prune
prune-under = Objects and covers no track or album names any more, and staging files left behind. Count them, then take them away.
release-name = Release
release-under = Points each track back at its own file where that is still there. A track the vault holds the only copy of stays in it.
compact-name = Compact covers
compact-under = Swaps a JPEG cover kept as it came for a byte-exact JXL copy where that takes less room.
