ask-again-to-mend = Press it again to mend. Each track of an object that did not read back is pointed at its own file, to be weighed again by the next import, and each album lets go of a cover that did not.
ask-again-to-take-away = Press it again to take them away, for good.
ask-again-to-release = Press it again to release. The objects released are left for Prune to take away.
ask-again-to-compact = Press it again to swap the covers. Each swap is proved to give the very JPEG back.
nothing-to-check = The vault holds nothing to check
